00:15:38.000 --> 00:16:17.000
The car couldn't see an 18-wheeler going broadside in front of it and so plowed right into it. I would say there's double fault there. And in fact, the National Transportation Safety Board, that's exactly what they said. They said, one, the driver bore fault because they ignored the warnings, but also the company bore fault because it was allowing this car to operate in a situation. It couldn't handle. It allowed the car to keep cruising down the road, even though the driver was ignoring it. it allowed the car to operate on a road where you could have an 18-wheeler crossing in front of it.
汽车没能看到一辆横在它面前的18轮大货车，所以直接撞了上去。我会说那里有双重过错。事实上，国家运输安全委员会正是这么说的。他们说，第一，驾驶员有过错，因为他们忽视了警告，但公司也有过错，因为它允许这辆车在它无法处理的情况下运行。它允许汽车继续在路上行驶，即使驾驶员忽视了它。它允许汽车在可能有一辆18轮大货车横穿其前方的道路上行驶。

